{"id":441,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"徳健財と6年一貫で人間力を磨く","feature_description":"清風南海は「徳・健・財」を掲げ、六ヵ年一貫で学力と人間性を同時に育てる学校です。授業は速い進度だけでなく、復習や探究を組み合わせて深さも重視します。学校紹介では学園の特色、グローバル探究ゼミ、部活動まで一体で示され、学校生活全体が学びを支えています。自立的精神を養う点も明確です。 入学と同時に担任団が学年を持ち上がり、教科指導と生活指導を六年間で見通せるのも安心です。","clubs":[{"id":8654,"name":"剣道部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8655,"name":"硬式テニス部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8656,"name":"サッカー部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8657,"name":"陸上部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8658,"name":"ソフトボール部(男)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8659,"name":"卓球部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8660,"name":"バスケットボール部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8661,"name":"バレーボール部(男)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8662,"name":"テコンドー部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8663,"name":"タッチラグビー部(男)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8664,"name":"インターアクト部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8665,"name":"吹奏楽部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8666,"nam